{"ref":"BDB, מִלּוּא","hw":"מִלּוּא","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מִלּוּא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלֻּא</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. setting, installation</strong>; <strong>(</strong>cf. vb. <strong>Pi. Pu.)</strong>;—pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלֻּאִים (מִלּוּ׳)</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:7\" href=\"/Exodus.25.7\">Ex 25:7</a> + 13 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלֻּאֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.33\">Lv 8:33</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>setting</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְנֵי מ׳</span> <em>stones for setting</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:7\" href=\"/Exodus.25.7\">Ex 25:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:9\" href=\"/Exodus.35.9\">35:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:27\" href=\"/Exodus.35.27\">27</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.2\">1 Ch 29:2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אַבְנֵי שֹׁ֫הַם וּמ׳)</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  installation (of priests): <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:37\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.37\">Lv 7:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.33\">8:33</a>; = installation-offering <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.28\">8:28</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשָּׁה</span>) cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">סַל־הַמּ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.31\">31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיל הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:22\" href=\"/Exodus.29.22\">Ex 29:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:26\" href=\"/Exodus.29.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:27\" href=\"/Exodus.29.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:3\" href=\"/Exodus.29.3\">3</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.22\">Lv 8:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:29\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.29\">29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּשַׂר הַמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:34\" href=\"/Exodus.29.34\">Ex 29:34</a>.","next":"BDB, מִלּוֹא","prev":"BDB, מִלֻּאָה"}